                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There is no pause. You may think there would be, but 'pausing' only brings up a menu, it doesn't stop anything, like rising acid in vertical platforming.\n\nSpeaking of, there's a bunch of that. Yes, it's one hit kill. No, stages don't have have checkpoints. Yes, you lose the currency you need to clear a stage upon death.\n\nYou playing on fullscreen? There's no way to quit the game if you are. Every time you start the game again, your audio options aren't saved from the last time.\n\nMagic isn't actually useful, and the only reason you'll have full MP is because you're never using it.\n\nPeople are all \"oh this is old school hard.\" Yeah, I lived through those, and this isn't fun.",
